# heavy media and car images
# NOTE: the 13 model-matched fallback images below MUST stay tracked — the home page
# New Arrivals / Featured Cars sections depend on them as the last-resort image when
# the Convex storage proxy is unreachable. If they are ignored, Vercel never deploys
# them and the fallbacks silently 404 (served as SPA HTML instead of an image).
/public/cars/*
!/public/cars/kia_rio_28672837_1.jpg
!/public/cars/volkswagen_polovivo_28640896_1.jpg
!/public/cars/volkswagen_polo_27844862_1.jpg
!/public/cars/volkswagen_tcross_28544392_1.jpg
!/public/cars/haval_jolionpro_28674518_1.jpg
